// Bandit Level 14 → Level 15

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 14 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit14@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 13.

Step3: The password for the next level is stored in `/etc/bandit_pass/bandit14`, but we need to submit it to a service running on port `30000`.

Step4: Read the current level's password:

        cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit14

Step5: Send the password to the service running on port `30000` using `nc`:

        nc localhost 30000

Step6: Paste the password obtained from `/etc/bandit_pass/bandit14` and press Enter.

Step7: The service returns the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit15`.

Step8: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit15@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step9: The Bandit Level 14 → Level 15 challenge is solved.

Step10: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
